# Root ignore file.
#
# C4 / A11: signing material must never be committed. `android/.gitignore`
# already covers the android/ subtree; these patterns also catch a keystore
# created at the repository root (the example command in
# `android/key.properties.example` writes to ~/jarvis-release.jks, but people
# copy files around).
android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
